1
00:00:05,192 --> 00:00:06,600
Give me your money!

2
00:00:07,310 --> 00:00:09,480
- Phob! Watch out!
- You think you're good?

3
00:00:15,115 --> 00:00:16,600
Nobody can find us here.

4
00:00:16,918 --> 00:00:18,840
We can meet here, what do you think?

5
00:00:18,907 --> 00:00:21,000
Tinnakorn are leaving the city quite often.

6
00:00:21,843 --> 00:00:22,844
I'm worried about him.

7
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:25,840
The Royal Palace Office didn't have any work in the country lately.

8
00:00:26,035 --> 00:00:28,400
The sources reported that the soldiers from our side were arrested.

9
00:00:28,824 --> 00:00:30,872
We need to transform the nation soon.

10
00:00:33,051 --> 00:00:34,052
Phob, do you like it?

11
00:00:34,152 --> 00:00:36,360
I asked them to make it special for us.

12
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:37,601
Of course, I do.

13
00:02:16,050 --> 00:02:17,180
Has Tinnakorn left?

14
00:02:17,794 --> 00:02:18,795
Yes, Your Highness.

15
00:02:19,612 --> 00:02:20,700
Do you know where he went?

16
00:02:32,172 --> 00:02:33,460
What are you craving today?

17
00:02:34,514 --> 00:02:35,620
I'm good with anything.

18
00:03:08,700 --> 00:03:10,300
This is the first time I've been behind the ministry.

19
00:03:12,594 --> 00:03:13,820
The place was dark and gloomy.

20
00:03:17,799 --> 00:03:19,940
They're waiting to submit petitions to the King

21
00:03:20,700 --> 00:03:23,140
and seek help for the hardships they're facing.

22
00:03:26,300 --> 00:03:28,020
They're from all over the country.

23
00:03:29,823 --> 00:03:31,620
Some came from Prachin Buri,

24
00:03:32,191 --> 00:03:33,800
while others traveled from the Northeast.

25
00:03:43,788 --> 00:03:45,660
They must have been through a lot.

26
00:05:33,482 --> 00:05:34,780
I am all in.

27
00:05:35,978 --> 00:05:37,151
By the end of June,

28
00:05:37,700 --> 00:05:40,460
I'll get the money I invested back, plus the interest, right?

29
00:05:42,168 --> 00:05:43,362
Of course, you will.

30
00:05:43,772 --> 00:05:45,511
Don't you remember the last time you invested?

31
00:05:45,788 --> 00:05:48,060
You doubled your money in just a month.

32
00:05:49,989 --> 00:05:50,990
Good.

33
00:05:51,836 --> 00:05:54,740
If someone finds the documents showing I withdrew money

34
00:05:54,818 --> 00:05:56,420
from the project budget for something else,

35
00:05:57,228 --> 00:05:58,229
we're screwed.

36
00:05:58,380 --> 00:06:00,100
You can rest assured.

37
00:06:00,495 --> 00:06:03,900
The more we invest, the higher our returns will be.

38
00:06:04,506 --> 00:06:06,060
I guarantee that by the end of this month,

39
00:06:06,340 --> 00:06:09,560
we'll both be millionaires.

40
00:06:18,431 --> 00:06:19,340
This time,

41
00:06:20,340 --> 00:06:23,479
even after I pay the ministry back, I'll still make a profit.

42
00:06:24,631 --> 00:06:26,780
I'll buy everything I've ever wanted.

43
00:06:26,908 --> 00:06:28,220
Even my dad

44
00:06:29,140 --> 00:06:30,260
won't be able to keep up with me.

45
00:06:31,788 --> 00:06:33,700
Here's to getting rich!

46
00:06:41,431 --> 00:06:42,660
Let me top off your drink.

47
00:07:03,004 --> 00:07:04,005
You're not hungry?

48
00:07:06,684 --> 00:07:07,685
Not really.

49
00:07:11,666 --> 00:07:14,540
Seeing those people got to you, didn't it?

50
00:07:21,183 --> 00:07:22,540
They barely have anything to eat.

51
00:07:25,004 --> 00:07:26,700
- We shouldn't--
- We shouldn't splurge.

52
00:07:30,220 --> 00:07:31,221
You're right.

53
00:07:31,756 --> 00:07:33,372
What we're doing now is like

54
00:07:34,130 --> 00:07:36,820
feasting while they're starving.

55
00:07:44,615 --> 00:07:45,980
That's not what I meant.

56
00:07:48,124 --> 00:07:51,060
Look, I've even ruined the mood for you.

57
00:07:53,404 --> 00:07:55,239
Actually, the economic downturn

58
00:07:55,932 --> 00:07:57,020
is affecting the whole world.

59
00:07:57,756 --> 00:07:59,820
And it's not an easy problem to solve.

60
00:08:00,871 --> 00:08:04,282
All the royals are doing everything they can to find a solution.

61
00:08:10,602 --> 00:08:11,900
But for those who are suffering,

62
00:08:12,325 --> 00:08:14,260
sick, and hungry,

63
00:08:15,396 --> 00:08:16,580
they can't wait any longer, Your Highness.

64
00:08:17,316 --> 00:08:18,317
I know.

65
00:08:18,730 --> 00:08:20,620
But I simply don't have enough power

66
00:08:21,151 --> 00:08:22,458
to solve these problems.

67
00:08:23,140 --> 00:08:27,380
If anyone can lead this country out of this crisis,

68
00:08:28,241 --> 00:08:30,020
I'll gladly support them.

69
00:08:37,004 --> 00:08:38,005
Really?

70
00:08:38,471 --> 00:08:42,100
If someone is helping people overcome their hardships,

71
00:08:43,372 --> 00:08:46,060
you'll support them and you won't stand in their way.

72
00:08:46,903 --> 00:08:50,082
Also, you won't treat them as your enemies, will you?

73
00:08:51,447 --> 00:08:52,580
Of course, I won't.

74
00:08:53,612 --> 00:08:55,260
If they're doing what's best for the country,

75
00:08:55,554 --> 00:08:57,820
I should praise them.

76
00:08:58,087 --> 00:08:59,420
Why would I see them as my enemy?

77
00:09:01,770 --> 00:09:02,771
What is going on with you?

78
00:09:06,271 --> 00:09:09,180
My prince is the best.

79
00:09:10,319 --> 00:09:11,320
What?

80
00:09:13,420 --> 00:09:14,421
Phob!

81
00:09:15,167 --> 00:09:16,168
Dad!

82
00:09:28,151 --> 00:09:29,152
Dad!

83
00:09:30,271 --> 00:09:31,272
Prince Vasin!

84
00:09:31,724 --> 00:09:33,465
- Dad!
- Prince Vasin!

85
00:09:36,226 --> 00:09:37,660
What are you going to do to your son?

86
00:09:38,343 --> 00:09:39,700
I should be the one asking you

87
00:09:39,744 --> 00:09:41,460
what you've been trying to drag my son into this time.

88
00:09:41,882 --> 00:09:43,178
- Huh?
- Please, don't.

89
00:09:43,700 --> 00:09:44,701
Dad!

90
00:09:45,231 --> 00:09:46,340
Are you protecting him?

91
00:09:47,578 --> 00:09:49,394
You said you had to work out of town,

92
00:09:50,004 --> 00:09:52,420
but you were with him all along, weren't you?

93
00:09:53,490 --> 00:09:54,491
Tell me!

94
00:09:55,244 --> 00:09:56,245
Just tell me!

95
00:09:59,879 --> 00:10:00,880
Actually…

96
00:10:00,943 --> 00:10:01,944
- I--
- Hello.

97
00:10:02,322 --> 00:10:03,823
Hello, Uncle. How are you?

98
00:10:05,586 --> 00:10:06,587
Siri?

99
00:10:10,520 --> 00:10:12,372
I told Tinnakorn to meet me here.

100
00:10:13,215 --> 00:10:15,380
Have you eaten yet, Uncle?

101
00:10:16,042 --> 00:10:17,800
Why don't you join us?

102
00:10:18,298 --> 00:10:20,700
I ordered plenty of food.

103
00:10:24,551 --> 00:10:26,140
Didn't Tinnakorn come with Phobthee?

104
00:10:27,975 --> 00:10:29,940
No. Phob came with Janthorn.

105
00:10:30,359 --> 00:10:33,950
I ran into them, so I invited them to join us.

106
00:10:35,500 --> 00:10:36,501
That's right, Your Highness.

107
00:10:51,370 --> 00:10:53,940
You're lucky Janthorn and I showed up just in time.

108
00:10:54,823 --> 00:10:56,839
Siri, thank you so much.

109
00:10:57,879 --> 00:11:01,300
If there's anything I can help you two with, just let me know.

110
00:11:02,100 --> 00:11:03,101
Actually,

111
00:11:05,196 --> 00:11:07,223
Phob and I…

112
00:11:07,927 --> 00:11:09,300
I know

113
00:11:09,548 --> 00:11:11,950
you and Phob share a very special bond.

114
00:11:14,020 --> 00:11:15,260
Siri, I'm so sorry.

115
00:11:16,276 --> 00:11:18,122
You don't have to apologize to me.

116
00:11:18,546 --> 00:11:21,100
I know how hard it is to live by the rules of your rank

117
00:11:21,279 --> 00:11:24,140
and carry the burden of your family's honor.

118
00:11:26,042 --> 00:11:27,550
I truly wish

119
00:11:27,882 --> 00:11:30,460
you and Phob all the happiness in the world.

120
00:11:30,927 --> 00:11:32,940
May the two of you finally be together.

121
00:11:33,263 --> 00:11:36,020
I'm happy

122
00:11:36,484 --> 00:11:37,780
just to be your sister.

123
00:11:39,343 --> 00:11:40,344
Siri.

124
00:11:43,140 --> 00:11:44,420
Thank you so much,

125
00:11:46,364 --> 00:11:47,540
my lovely sister.

126
00:11:50,620 --> 00:11:51,621
Thank you from the bottom of my heart.

127
00:11:56,647 --> 00:11:58,660
- Where are you going?
- To Varakulvatin Palace.

128
00:11:58,743 --> 00:12:00,940
I'm worried his father will beat him the way he beat me.

129
00:12:01,416 --> 00:12:02,660
You need to get it together!

130
00:12:04,948 --> 00:12:07,020
You'll only make things worse if you show up like this!

131
00:12:12,135 --> 00:12:13,340
Is this why

132
00:12:13,762 --> 00:12:15,620
you don't want to pry information out of Prince Tinnakorn?

133
00:12:28,348 --> 00:12:29,349
Tinnakorn.

134
00:12:37,948 --> 00:12:38,949
Yes, Dad?

135
00:12:40,866 --> 00:12:43,260
So, you really have a date with Siri, don't you?

136
00:12:44,924 --> 00:12:46,780
I was just about to talk to you about her.

137
00:12:48,338 --> 00:12:49,339
What is it?

138
00:12:50,636 --> 00:12:52,244
I'd like to call off my engagement to her.

139
00:12:53,919 --> 00:12:55,140
What were you thinking?

140
00:12:55,620 --> 00:12:57,060
Have you lost your mind?

141
00:12:58,980 --> 00:13:00,140
You're willing to leave

142
00:13:00,452 --> 00:13:02,820
a wonderful woman like her because of Phob?

143
00:13:02,932 --> 00:13:04,740
It's because she's such a wonderful woman

144
00:13:04,986 --> 00:13:06,660
that she shouldn't waste her time on me.

145
00:13:08,528 --> 00:13:12,020
You know it well that I can't be a good husband to her.

146
00:13:12,884 --> 00:13:13,885
So what?

147
00:13:14,762 --> 00:13:15,940
What's your plan after calling off the engagement?

148
00:13:16,527 --> 00:13:17,528
Are you going to live with him?

149
00:13:18,548 --> 00:13:19,820
Wake up already!

150
00:13:21,100 --> 00:13:23,380
Nobody can accept you for who you are.

151
00:13:24,580 --> 00:13:27,700
You will ruin our family's reputation.

152
00:13:27,882 --> 00:13:29,500
Ruin the family's reputation?

153
00:13:31,580 --> 00:13:33,940
I've always done everything you've asked of me.

154
00:13:35,087 --> 00:13:36,740
I studied what you wanted me to study.

155
00:13:37,571 --> 00:13:38,800
I pursued the career you chose for me.

156
00:13:39,700 --> 00:13:41,220
I've always upheld our family's reputation.

157
00:13:41,332 --> 00:13:43,400
What else do I have to do to satisfy you?

158
00:13:43,500 --> 00:13:44,860
Be the man!

159
00:13:46,900 --> 00:13:49,140
Be like every other man.

160
00:13:50,502 --> 00:13:52,620
Get married and have children

161
00:13:53,471 --> 00:13:54,820
to carry on our family's legacy.

162
00:13:55,962 --> 00:13:57,740
Stop living in a fantasy world

163
00:13:57,844 --> 00:13:59,560
and stop doing those disgusting things with him.

164
00:14:01,156 --> 00:14:02,660
If anyone finds out about the two of you,

165
00:14:02,863 --> 00:14:06,220
our family will become the laughingstock of the entire city.

166
00:14:15,023 --> 00:14:16,024
You're right.

167
00:14:18,895 --> 00:14:21,500
I must have humiliated you.

168
00:14:24,876 --> 00:14:26,060
What about this?

169
00:14:29,348 --> 00:14:31,500
Then disown me. Strip me of our family name,

170
00:14:32,482 --> 00:14:35,340
and forget that you ever had this disgraceful son.

171
00:14:35,367 --> 00:14:37,530
- Tinnakorn!
- What is it?

172
00:14:37,618 --> 00:14:38,980
Vasin!

173
00:14:39,276 --> 00:14:41,820
Are you going to hit your son?

174
00:14:44,228 --> 00:14:46,500
I don't care what you want.

175
00:14:47,124 --> 00:14:49,220
You're still going to marry Ruethaisiri.

176
00:15:21,842 --> 00:15:23,020
Vasin?

177
00:15:25,132 --> 00:15:26,133
Mom?

178
00:15:27,042 --> 00:15:30,562
Did you and Tinnakorn argue about Ruethaisiri?

179
00:15:33,900 --> 00:15:35,300
Don't you worry.

180
00:15:36,322 --> 00:15:39,100
He will have to marry Ruethaisiri.

181
00:15:41,082 --> 00:15:43,340
I'll speak to Ruethaisiri's father

182
00:15:43,663 --> 00:15:44,820
and have the wedding arranged as soon as possible.

183
00:15:46,783 --> 00:15:50,283
When you build a house, you build it for the people who are going to live in it.

184
00:15:50,660 --> 00:15:52,900
If he doesn't love her,

185
00:15:53,148 --> 00:15:55,250
you shouldn't force him to marry her.

186
00:15:55,959 --> 00:15:59,140
Ruethaisiri is the perfect match for him.

187
00:15:59,212 --> 00:16:01,540
But Tinnakorn is a good man.

188
00:16:01,671 --> 00:16:03,500
He has a good heart and a good head on his shoulders.

189
00:16:03,666 --> 00:16:08,151
I believe he'll choose the right woman for himself.

190
00:16:08,823 --> 00:16:12,460
After all, it's his life. You need to let him make his own decisions.

191
00:16:14,127 --> 00:16:16,400
This is the only thing that I can't let him.

192
00:16:16,554 --> 00:16:17,750
Why's that?

193
00:16:21,604 --> 00:16:24,740
Tinnakorn is the pride and honor of the Varakulvatin family.

194
00:16:25,546 --> 00:16:27,420
He's my greatest pride,

195
00:16:27,831 --> 00:16:29,940
and he should always remain that way.

196
00:16:31,026 --> 00:16:34,506
Tinnakorn should be a prince whom people respect

197
00:16:34,708 --> 00:16:36,060
and admire.

198
00:16:37,172 --> 00:16:40,695
He shouldn't turn into an object of ridicule and contempt.

199
00:16:40,903 --> 00:16:42,300
I have to protect him.

200
00:16:42,428 --> 00:16:44,660
What are you talking about? What is going on?

201
00:16:44,951 --> 00:16:48,700
It's not that big of a deal.

202
00:16:49,052 --> 00:16:51,660
It's just that Tin doesn't want to get married.

203
00:17:06,138 --> 00:17:07,139
What is this?

204
00:17:07,740 --> 00:17:10,700
Why is the pension disbursement for the Department of Mineral Resources

205
00:17:11,020 --> 00:17:13,700
taking so long? What's holding it up?

206
00:17:16,522 --> 00:17:19,860
There were some issues with the paperwork.

207
00:17:21,220 --> 00:17:22,580
Hurry up and fix it.

208
00:17:23,216 --> 00:17:27,300
The Minister will be here to inspect it himself at the end of the month.

209
00:17:29,674 --> 00:17:30,675
Yes, sir.

210
00:17:39,770 --> 00:17:42,260
Could you help speed up the coal mine dividend payment?

211
00:17:42,820 --> 00:17:46,380
There's going to be a major audit at the end of the month.

212
00:17:46,468 --> 00:17:47,800
If the Minister finds out I've taken the money,

213
00:17:48,132 --> 00:17:50,460
we'll both end up In jail.

214
00:17:50,978 --> 00:17:53,540
Sure, sir. I will speed it up for you.

215
00:17:53,682 --> 00:17:57,140
Don't you worry. I never broke your promise.

216
00:17:57,436 --> 00:17:58,700
Come on, let's drink.

217
00:17:59,876 --> 00:18:01,220
Let's have a drink with me.

218
00:18:12,871 --> 00:18:14,260
Don't stress. It will be fine.

219
00:19:00,626 --> 00:19:01,836
We don't have much time.

220
00:19:02,311 --> 00:19:05,800
If we leave this too long, I'm afraid they might uncover something.

221
00:19:06,351 --> 00:19:08,460
We have to act to change this country soon.

222
00:19:08,735 --> 00:19:11,060
Otherwise, we may never get another chance.

223
00:20:20,500 --> 00:20:22,501
[ June 22, 1932]

224
00:20:30,450 --> 00:20:31,451
Phob?

225
00:20:31,858 --> 00:20:33,220
Have you received the official schedule yet?

226
00:20:35,539 --> 00:20:36,540
Yeah.

227
00:20:36,804 --> 00:20:39,476
I made a copy, and I'll give it to Mr. Kitti.

228
00:20:42,916 --> 00:20:43,940
I haven't heard from Prince Tinnakorn

229
00:20:44,831 --> 00:20:46,500
since the incident at the restaurant.

230
00:20:48,804 --> 00:20:50,580
This is for our country and people.

231
00:20:51,375 --> 00:20:54,700
When that day comes, he will understand you.

232
00:21:19,228 --> 00:21:20,660
Thank you for the information, Phobthee.

233
00:21:21,842 --> 00:21:23,500
This is the right time for us.

234
00:21:25,026 --> 00:21:26,220
What do you mean?

235
00:21:27,532 --> 00:21:29,220
The 115 members of the Army, the Navy,

236
00:21:29,463 --> 00:21:32,020
and the civilian sector have unanimously agreed

237
00:21:33,303 --> 00:21:35,140
that we should carry out the change in government

238
00:21:36,023 --> 00:21:37,950
on Friday, June 24.

239
00:21:39,362 --> 00:21:40,363
The next two days?

240
00:21:40,439 --> 00:21:41,440
That's right.

241
00:21:42,200 --> 00:21:44,820
We don't know when those two who were arrested might talk.

242
00:21:45,546 --> 00:21:46,780
We have to make our move now.

243
00:21:47,212 --> 00:21:49,420
This will be our last meeting.

244
00:21:50,890 --> 00:21:53,940
We won't meet again until the day we make our move.

245
00:21:54,522 --> 00:21:57,540
So pay close attention to the plan.

246
00:22:01,559 --> 00:22:02,560
This moment

247
00:22:03,060 --> 00:22:05,140
is the most crucial time.

248
00:22:20,578 --> 00:22:22,460
This is the most precarious moment.

249
00:22:23,207 --> 00:22:24,980
The Commander General of the 1st Division,

250
00:22:25,460 --> 00:22:27,540
one of our key forces,

251
00:22:28,023 --> 00:22:31,380
has been assigned to visit Ratchaburi and the southern provinces.

252
00:22:31,836 --> 00:22:33,420
He won't return until next month.

253
00:22:34,100 --> 00:22:36,580
Besides, many of the Navy's senior officers are on leave.

254
00:22:37,431 --> 00:22:41,180
That means we're the only ones left in the capital.

255
00:22:43,788 --> 00:22:46,300
If anyone intended to overthrow the government,

256
00:22:46,932 --> 00:22:48,660
they'd seize this opportunity without hesitation.

257
00:22:57,916 --> 00:23:00,540
Your Highness, My informants report that

258
00:23:01,036 --> 00:23:03,660
military and civil officers who studied in France

259
00:23:04,119 --> 00:23:06,940
have been openly meeting with mid-ranking officials.

260
00:23:10,828 --> 00:23:12,200
They must be speeding up their plans.

261
00:23:13,756 --> 00:23:15,660
We have to force those two soldiers

262
00:23:15,874 --> 00:23:18,340
to give up the names of everyone in the movement.

263
00:23:30,060 --> 00:23:31,061
Aum.

264
00:23:31,100 --> 00:23:32,101
Yes?

265
00:23:32,524 --> 00:23:33,620
Is it for Tinnakorn?

266
00:23:34,023 --> 00:23:35,024
Yes, Your Highness.

267
00:23:35,551 --> 00:23:36,552
I'll bring it to him.

268
00:23:47,530 --> 00:23:48,531
Tinnakorn

269
00:23:52,362 --> 00:23:53,363
Hey, it's me.

270
00:25:57,028 --> 00:25:58,029
Phob?

271
00:26:00,266 --> 00:26:01,267
What's wrong?

272
00:26:05,236 --> 00:26:07,420
I waited up for you until I fell asleep.

273
00:26:09,359 --> 00:26:10,360
I didn't think

274
00:26:11,348 --> 00:26:14,100
your dad would ever let you out again.

275
00:26:18,428 --> 00:26:19,800
I'm not a kid anymore.

276
00:26:21,612 --> 00:26:23,120
If he wouldn't let me out, I'd just sneak out.

277
00:26:24,162 --> 00:26:25,163
I know you'd come to see me.

278
00:26:27,623 --> 00:26:29,340
My prince is the best.

279
00:26:36,026 --> 00:26:38,122
Is something bothering you?

280
00:26:41,364 --> 00:26:42,500
You can tell me.

281
00:26:44,527 --> 00:26:45,528
Come on.

282
00:27:13,324 --> 00:27:14,340
Can you wait for me here

283
00:27:16,084 --> 00:27:17,660
for the next two days?

284
00:27:21,052 --> 00:27:22,053
What is going on?

285
00:27:25,676 --> 00:27:27,100
I have something important to take care of.

286
00:27:30,146 --> 00:27:31,660
If you stay here and wait for me,

287
00:27:33,007 --> 00:27:34,340
it'll put my mind at ease.

288
00:27:36,020 --> 00:27:37,180
Something important?

289
00:27:38,650 --> 00:27:41,388
What is it? Can I help you?

290
00:27:42,551 --> 00:27:44,180
I can help you with anything.

291
00:27:44,300 --> 00:27:46,100
You can let me know

292
00:27:46,572 --> 00:27:47,780
about your important mission.

293
00:27:48,418 --> 00:27:50,250
I don't want to see you so stressed like this.

294
00:27:50,860 --> 00:27:51,861
You know?

295
00:27:57,400 --> 00:28:00,138
I can help you with anything.

296
00:28:08,108 --> 00:28:09,780
Just being here is good enough for me.

297
00:28:11,986 --> 00:28:12,987
There is one thing

298
00:28:15,460 --> 00:28:16,820
I'd like you to know.

299
00:28:23,855 --> 00:28:24,860
Whatever happens

300
00:28:27,140 --> 00:28:28,580
from now on,

301
00:28:31,919 --> 00:28:33,300
please remember one thing,

302
00:28:37,060 --> 00:28:39,020
I never meant to hurt you.

303
00:28:57,239 --> 00:28:58,300
I love you.

304
00:28:59,708 --> 00:29:00,729
I love you so much.

305
00:29:03,367 --> 00:29:04,750
I love you more than anything.

306
00:29:05,212 --> 00:29:07,200
- Phob?
- More than my own life.

307
00:29:07,874 --> 00:29:08,875
What is going on?

308
00:29:10,060 --> 00:29:11,180
Why are you--

309
00:29:16,266 --> 00:29:17,267
Phob?

310
00:30:32,300 --> 00:30:35,060
[June 23, 1932]

311
00:30:44,610 --> 00:30:45,611
What's the update?

312
00:30:45,794 --> 00:30:46,795
I've got a lead.

313
00:30:46,812 --> 00:30:48,700
I know where your son is.

314
00:31:14,943 --> 00:31:15,944
Please wait for me here

315
00:31:17,367 --> 00:31:18,750
tomorrow.

316
00:31:19,932 --> 00:31:20,933
Do not leave this house.

317
00:31:22,604 --> 00:31:24,800
You keep telling me this, and I'm starting to get scared.

318
00:31:25,970 --> 00:31:27,100
What is happening tomorrow?

319
00:31:34,514 --> 00:31:35,515
I'll tell you everything

320
00:31:36,647 --> 00:31:37,950
when it is done.

321
00:31:39,410 --> 00:31:40,111
Okay?

322
00:31:46,090 --> 00:31:47,420
Come back soon. I'll be waiting here.

323
00:32:11,188 --> 00:32:12,300
I'll wait for you here.

324
00:33:02,079 --> 00:33:03,080
Is that Phob?

325
00:33:05,850 --> 00:33:06,860
Did he forget something?

326
00:33:12,708 --> 00:33:13,709
Dad?

327
00:33:15,887 --> 00:33:18,100
Did you really think I wouldn't be able to find you?

328
00:33:18,607 --> 00:33:19,608
Go home!

329
00:33:20,116 --> 00:33:22,410
I'm not going home with you. I will stay here.

330
00:33:23,660 --> 00:33:24,661
Hey!

331
00:33:25,274 --> 00:33:26,820
You think you have a choice?

332
00:33:27,359 --> 00:33:28,460
Come here and take him home!

333
00:33:28,586 --> 00:33:29,860
- Yes, Your Highness.
- No! I'm not going.

334
00:33:29,930 --> 00:33:30,931
Dad!

335
00:33:32,260 --> 00:33:33,261
Let me go!

336
00:33:33,546 --> 00:33:34,547
Dad!

337
00:33:35,034 --> 00:33:37,800
I will stay here! You can't bring me home!

338
00:33:38,800 --> 00:33:41,260
I will stay here!

339
00:33:50,380 --> 00:33:51,381
Stay here!

340
00:33:51,887 --> 00:33:53,700
And you won't see him again!

341
00:33:54,420 --> 00:33:55,421
Do it!

342
00:33:57,340 --> 00:33:58,541
Go ahead and lock me up!

343
00:34:00,241 --> 00:34:02,340
As long as I'm alive,

344
00:34:02,882 --> 00:34:04,476
I'll find a way to get out and see him.

345
00:34:04,983 --> 00:34:05,984
Tinnakorn!

346
00:34:07,724 --> 00:34:09,340
What has he done to you?

347
00:34:10,706 --> 00:34:13,940
What happened to the son I was once so proud of?

348
00:34:14,012 --> 00:34:15,341
I've never changed, Dad.

349
00:34:17,095 --> 00:34:18,500
This is who I am.

350
00:34:20,400 --> 00:34:22,700
I just want to be with someone I love.

351
00:34:24,108 --> 00:34:25,940
That's all I've ever wanted.

352
00:34:26,860 --> 00:34:29,906
Is it that bad?

353
00:34:31,052 --> 00:34:33,762
Your life isn't yours alone.

354
00:34:34,900 --> 00:34:37,460
You are the honor of this family.

355
00:34:38,055 --> 00:34:39,461
The honor?

356
00:34:41,532 --> 00:34:45,500
If having that honor means living without Phob,

357
00:34:47,143 --> 00:34:48,660
then I don't want it.

358
00:34:50,508 --> 00:34:53,400
Honor has never made me happy.

359
00:34:54,900 --> 00:34:56,940
All it's ever brought me is misery.

360
00:34:58,210 --> 00:35:00,260
All it's ever given me is a burden.

361
00:35:01,882 --> 00:35:04,100
I just want to be free.

362
00:35:05,700 --> 00:35:07,900
I just want to be with the man I love.

363
00:35:09,340 --> 00:35:13,220
That's the only thing I've ever wanted in my life. I'll never ask you for anything ever again.

364
00:35:14,700 --> 00:35:16,487
Can you give it to me?

365
00:35:17,564 --> 00:35:20,060
Stop being so shallow!

366
00:35:22,162 --> 00:35:24,380
Do you really think that kind of twisted and distorted love

367
00:35:24,460 --> 00:35:26,340
will ever make you happy?

368
00:35:26,759 --> 00:35:29,100
You'll be looked down on,

369
00:35:29,265 --> 00:35:30,466
ridiculed, and laughed at.

370
00:35:31,600 --> 00:35:33,800
You'll be forced to live, and you'd wish you were dead.

371
00:35:34,620 --> 00:35:35,940
Live a life worse than death?

372
00:35:38,740 --> 00:35:39,900
It's not different from now, is it?

373
00:35:41,900 --> 00:35:45,220
You're killing me from the inside!

374
00:35:54,087 --> 00:35:55,700
Was that necessary?

375
00:36:06,183 --> 00:36:07,184
Dad!

376
00:36:08,431 --> 00:36:09,620
Please, I beg you.

377
00:36:11,369 --> 00:36:13,500
Can I live with Phob?

378
00:36:16,025 --> 00:36:18,945
Please, let me live with him.

379
00:36:20,490 --> 00:36:21,860
I love him.

380
00:36:26,442 --> 00:36:28,420
Do you know how hard it was for me

381
00:36:29,586 --> 00:36:31,300
to live day by day

382
00:36:31,962 --> 00:36:34,200
when he wasn't around?

383
00:36:36,623 --> 00:36:39,621
When he came back into my life,

384
00:36:41,180 --> 00:36:44,100
I finally realized what true happiness felt like.

385
00:36:46,900 --> 00:36:50,580
I finally remembered what it felt like to smile.

386
00:36:52,180 --> 00:36:53,700
Please, I beg you.

387
00:36:54,768 --> 00:36:57,500
Can't you just let me be happy?

388
00:36:59,978 --> 00:37:02,000
Could you give me that?

389
00:37:08,762 --> 00:37:11,780
This is the only thing I'll ever ask of you.

390
00:37:26,720 --> 00:37:29,332
And that's the one thing I can't give you.

391
00:38:55,364 --> 00:38:56,365
Your Highness,

392
00:38:59,135 --> 00:39:00,136
what are you doing here?

393
00:39:02,671 --> 00:39:03,900
I'm getting some fresh air.

394
00:39:07,729 --> 00:39:08,950
I am so happy.

395
00:39:12,500 --> 00:39:13,900
I want to live like this forever.

396
00:39:19,116 --> 00:39:20,340
Why won't you?

397
00:39:22,284 --> 00:39:23,980
We will live like this

398
00:39:26,400 --> 00:39:27,860
and we will be happy like this

399
00:39:28,620 --> 00:39:29,621
forever.

400
00:39:50,400 --> 00:39:51,401
What are you looking at?

401
00:39:51,500 --> 00:39:52,540
I'm watching the moon.

402
00:39:56,440 --> 00:39:59,140
It's a full moon tonight. I haven't seen one in a long time.

403
00:40:02,836 --> 00:40:03,837
It's pretty, isn't it?

404
00:40:10,412 --> 00:40:11,413
It is.

405
00:40:16,316 --> 00:40:19,420
I'll do whatever it takes to get back to you.

406
00:40:31,711 --> 00:40:32,712
Grandma?

407
00:40:45,604 --> 00:40:46,605
Tin.

408
00:40:47,791 --> 00:40:51,992
What is going on between you and Phob?

409
00:40:53,780 --> 00:40:54,781
I…

410
00:40:57,600 --> 00:40:58,820
I overheard

411
00:41:00,356 --> 00:41:02,580
your argument with your father.

412
00:41:06,794 --> 00:41:08,442
Is it true?

413
00:41:09,119 --> 00:41:10,500
- Grandma, I--
- About you and Phob?

414
00:41:12,900 --> 00:41:13,901
Grandma, I--

415
00:41:15,284 --> 00:41:17,988
Please forgive me for causing you so much sorrow, Grandma.

416
00:41:19,103 --> 00:41:20,940
Is it the reason

417
00:41:23,000 --> 00:41:24,800
that Nual and Phob

418
00:41:25,879 --> 00:41:28,375
needed to leave the palace?

419
00:41:30,447 --> 00:41:31,448
That's right.

420
00:41:32,927 --> 00:41:35,274
Please don't be mad at Phob.

421
00:41:35,711 --> 00:41:37,146
This is my fault.

422
00:41:38,932 --> 00:41:40,980
It is all my fault.

423
00:41:41,812 --> 00:41:45,340
Please forgive me for disappointing you, Grandma.

424
00:41:45,360 --> 00:41:47,180
I'm sorry.

425
00:41:47,866 --> 00:41:49,140
I know

426
00:41:49,647 --> 00:41:51,900
my mistake is far too great to forgive.

427
00:41:55,135 --> 00:41:57,700
From now on, I won't show my face to you again.

428
00:42:10,671 --> 00:42:15,142
Everything I have of value is in here.

429
00:42:16,000 --> 00:42:17,460
I want you to have it all.

430
00:42:18,572 --> 00:42:19,870
Take it, build a life for yourself,

431
00:42:20,748 --> 00:42:23,111
and be with the one you love.

432
00:42:25,495 --> 00:42:26,743
Here, take it all.

433
00:42:26,866 --> 00:42:28,580
You're not mad at me?

434
00:42:29,026 --> 00:42:31,180
Why would I be mad at you?

435
00:42:32,466 --> 00:42:35,450
You just want to live your own life.

436
00:42:38,376 --> 00:42:41,300
But I've brought shame upon the our family.

437
00:42:43,847 --> 00:42:45,940
Varakulvatin's reputation will be ruined because of me.

438
00:42:45,980 --> 00:42:48,780
I've brought our family to ruin, Grandma.

439
00:43:00,684 --> 00:43:01,685
Tinnakorn,

440
00:43:02,876 --> 00:43:04,060
listen to me.

441
00:43:05,615 --> 00:43:08,060
If honor and dignity

442
00:43:08,986 --> 00:43:12,100
must come at the cost

443
00:43:12,271 --> 00:43:15,700
of my grandchildren's suffering and pain,

444
00:43:17,060 --> 00:43:18,660
then I don’t want any part of them.

445
00:43:20,783 --> 00:43:21,784
Grandma.

446
00:43:22,628 --> 00:43:23,900
It's okay.

447
00:43:28,616 --> 00:43:31,348
It's gonna be okay.

448
00:43:32,639 --> 00:43:33,640
Listen to me,

449
00:43:34,916 --> 00:43:38,010
you have to stay strong from now on.

450
00:43:38,788 --> 00:43:40,060
You have to be with Phob.

451
00:43:41,209 --> 00:43:43,060
Don't worry about us here.

452
00:43:44,623 --> 00:43:46,740
I will talk to your dad.

453
00:43:47,284 --> 00:43:49,260
Wait until your dad has calmed down

454
00:43:49,567 --> 00:43:51,391
and his anger has eased.

455
00:43:51,775 --> 00:43:53,162
Then I will tell you

456
00:43:54,356 --> 00:43:58,750
to bring Phob back so the two of you can ask for his forgiveness, okay?

457
00:44:02,740 --> 00:44:03,741
You should go.

458
00:44:11,775 --> 00:44:12,776
Just go, darling.

459
00:44:13,490 --> 00:44:16,380
- You promised?
- Sure, just go.

460
00:44:24,380 --> 00:44:26,660
May the heavens and all the holy spirits

461
00:44:28,820 --> 00:44:30,780
please watch over and protect

462
00:44:31,530 --> 00:44:34,820
my beloved grandson.

463
00:44:41,260 --> 00:44:43,800
[At dawn on June 24, 1932.]

464
00:44:43,861 --> 00:44:46,220
[Siamese Revolution]

465
00:44:48,243 --> 00:44:51,660
We'll gather as many troops as possible at the Royal Plaza.

466
00:44:52,332 --> 00:44:55,260
Some will be brought in from the Royal Military Academy
and the Army Engineer Regiment.

467
00:44:55,756 --> 00:44:57,180
I'll tell them that it is for a training exercise.

468
00:44:59,900 --> 00:45:03,020
As for the rest, I'll tell them there's been a riot.

469
00:45:09,492 --> 00:45:12,020
I thought you said there was a riot. Why isn't anyone here?

470
00:45:12,458 --> 00:45:13,820
But once they're here,

471
00:45:14,244 --> 00:45:16,620
they'll have no choice but to obey their commanding officers.

472
00:45:19,140 --> 00:45:20,800
Everyone, stay calm.

473
00:45:23,092 --> 00:45:24,820
This is not the time to ask questions.

474
00:45:26,140 --> 00:45:28,420
Listen only to your commanding officer's orders.

475
00:45:37,418 --> 00:45:40,400
The moment the operation begins, we'll cut all telephone and telegraph lines.

476
00:45:42,839 --> 00:45:45,260
- The royals and high-ranking officers who are out of the capital
- [Noppalak Palace]

477
00:45:45,314 --> 00:45:47,140
won't be able to communicate or interfere.

478
00:45:50,743 --> 00:45:51,744
After today,

479
00:45:53,271 --> 00:45:55,250
nothing will ever be the same.

480
00:46:11,252 --> 00:46:14,860
From the list of names those two gave us,

481
00:46:15,306 --> 00:46:17,180
there isn't a single high-ranking officer among them,

482
00:46:18,340 --> 00:46:21,870
or anyone in command of any significant military force.

483
00:46:22,356 --> 00:46:25,807
Can they truly carry out a change of government?

484
00:46:27,674 --> 00:46:28,900
We can't be too prepared.

485
00:46:30,060 --> 00:46:31,900
They were all educated in France.

486
00:46:32,652 --> 00:46:34,540
If they're truly intent on changing the government,

487
00:46:35,778 --> 00:46:37,860
they could be far more dangerous than we expect.

488
00:46:40,084 --> 00:46:41,220
Has the arrest warrant been issued yet?

489
00:46:41,684 --> 00:46:44,400
The Director-General said it would be ready by 11.

490
00:46:52,698 --> 00:46:53,740
Who the hell are you?

491
00:46:55,631 --> 00:46:58,260
Do you know the penalty for invading the palace?

492
00:47:08,580 --> 00:47:09,581
Phob!

493
00:47:11,487 --> 00:47:12,820
Please remain calm, everyone.

494
00:47:14,394 --> 00:47:16,671
As of this moment, Khana Ratsadon

495
00:47:17,860 --> 00:47:20,060
has taken control of the government already.

496
00:47:25,948 --> 00:47:29,340
We have no intention of harming anyone.

497
00:47:30,450 --> 00:47:31,620
If anyone choose to resist,

498
00:47:34,146 --> 00:47:35,980
we will act decisively.

499
00:47:55,570 --> 00:47:57,700
This is an announcement from Khana Ratsadon.

500
00:48:01,980 --> 00:48:03,340
The government has filled

501
00:48:03,924 --> 00:48:06,300
key positions with relatives

502
00:48:07,044 --> 00:48:09,140
and unqualified sycophants.

503
00:48:10,410 --> 00:48:14,740
They have allowed officials to abuse their authority for personal gain.

504
00:48:15,628 --> 00:48:18,180
Bribes are taken in public construction projects

505
00:48:18,727 --> 00:48:21,100
and government procurement.

506
00:48:22,728 --> 00:48:26,540
Profits are made through currency exchange, while the nation's wealth is squandered.

507
00:48:28,060 --> 00:48:32,300
They have elevated their own circle, granting them privileges above those of the people.

508
00:48:32,900 --> 00:48:34,950
They have oppressed the people,

509
00:48:35,700 --> 00:48:37,861
governed without sound principles,

510
00:48:38,380 --> 00:48:41,140
and left the nation to drift aimlessly,

511
00:48:41,375 --> 00:48:44,780
as evidenced by the economic decline

512
00:48:45,071 --> 00:48:48,020
and the increasing hardship of making a living,

513
00:48:49,140 --> 00:48:52,800
as the people are already well aware.

514
00:48:55,794 --> 00:48:59,140
People of Siam,

515
00:48:59,780 --> 00:49:03,400
let it be known that this nation belongs to the people.

516
00:49:06,849 --> 00:49:09,740
We hereby announce to all the people

517
00:49:10,103 --> 00:49:14,742
that the Kingdom of Siam has changed its system of government.

518
00:49:15,178 --> 00:49:19,580
The authority to govern the nation now belongs to the people.

519
00:49:19,834 --> 00:49:23,780
Khana Ratsadon has secured control of all government offices

520
00:49:23,911 --> 00:49:26,900
and has taken the members of the Royal Family into custody.

521
00:49:27,479 --> 00:49:30,740
We ask all the people not to be alarmed

522
00:49:30,924 --> 00:49:34,740
and to work together to preserve the peace of the nation.

523
00:49:40,052 --> 00:49:41,700
How did it happen?

524
00:49:49,484 --> 00:49:53,260
Therefore, the people, the government officials,

525
00:49:53,794 --> 00:49:56,060
along with military and civilian officials

526
00:49:56,774 --> 00:50:01,580
who saw through the government's corrupt conduct,

527
00:50:02,111 --> 00:50:05,260
joined together to form the People's Party (Khana Ratsadon)

528
00:50:05,738 --> 00:50:08,900
and have now taken over the powers of the King.

529
00:50:21,271 --> 00:50:22,272
I can't believe it!

530
00:50:23,060 --> 00:50:24,180
What's going on?

531
00:50:24,788 --> 00:50:26,660
Your Highness! Your Highness!

532
00:50:26,980 --> 00:50:27,981
Your Highness!

533
00:50:29,903 --> 00:50:30,904
Your Highness!

534
00:50:31,071 --> 00:50:34,180
A rally is now taking place at the Royal Plaza.

535
00:50:34,799 --> 00:50:37,220
People who have suffered under the government's failures

536
00:50:37,455 --> 00:50:38,580
are called to gether there.

537
00:50:39,060 --> 00:50:42,581
This will be the first time the people's voices truly matter.

538
00:50:47,180 --> 00:50:49,540
Stand together. Siam is about to change.

539
00:50:53,380 --> 00:50:56,580
This is for people's rights and freedom.

540
00:50:58,060 --> 00:50:59,300
Siam is about to change.

541
00:51:07,967 --> 00:51:12,460
Khana Ratsadon believes that these injustices can only be corrected

542
00:51:12,666 --> 00:51:16,860
by establishing a system of government with a legislative assembly,

543
00:51:17,140 --> 00:51:20,300
where many opinions may be brought together in deliberation,

544
00:51:20,490 --> 00:51:22,200
for the wisdom of many is better than the judgment of one.

545
00:51:58,563 --> 00:52:00,760
I want us to stay together like this forever.

546
00:52:00,840 --> 00:52:02,880
Sure, we can. If you won't let go of my hand,

547
00:52:03,011 --> 00:52:04,920
I won't let go of yours.

548
00:52:07,880 --> 00:52:11,040
As long as I'm alive, you'll never get what you want.

549
00:52:12,016 --> 00:52:14,040
- Chat! Hey!
- Tin! Help me!

550
00:52:14,138 --> 00:52:15,520
I didn't even get to see Phob before everything happened.

551
00:52:15,539 --> 00:52:17,280
I will ask him to help us.

552
00:52:18,331 --> 00:52:20,640
In the end, was the path I chose

553
00:52:21,440 --> 00:52:22,700
truly worth it?

